  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Pachinko Fever — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p>At 18th level , you now roll 3d20 when deciding your multiplier, and can choose which roll you want. Your reverse cursed technique makes you regain hit points as if you had spent a number of cursed energy equal to twice your Cursed Energy modifier, and you can use <em>Reverse Cursed Technique</em> as a free action while you have the jackpot bonus.<br />\n In addition, your jackpot duration is now a number of minutes equal to your Cursed Energy modifier (min of 1).</p>",
